Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Notifications|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Notifications|
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
		|portletName|Wiki|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Wiki|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|password|password|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	Then User assign Regular Role CP
		|roleTitle|Administrator|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View Website Notification For New Wiki Page
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiPortlet subscribe To Node CP
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto All Pages PG
	And WikiPage add PG
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Page Content|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
	And Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|1|
	And Notifications goto Notifications
	And Notifications view New Content
		|assetType|wiki page|
		|contentBody|Wiki Page Title|
		|user|userfn userln|
	And Notifications navigate To Content
		|contentBody|Wiki Page Title|
	And WikiPage view PG
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Page Content|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	Then Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
